<title>USA: Research Alert - Liz Claiborne Inc lowered.</title>
<headline>Research Alert - Liz Claiborne Inc lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Montgomery Securities said it lowered its rating on Liz Claiborne Inc to a hold from a buy.</p>
<p>--No reason for the downgrade of the apparel manufacturer was given.</p>
</text>
